  "prefLabel": "Par 103.01 Jurisdiction",
  "priorExpiration": "1999-12-10",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Par 103.01 Jurisdiction.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 651-A:4, I, the board has the sole authority to grant parole to a New Hampshire state prison inmate.\n\n(b) Pursuant to RSA 651-A:4, II, the board has legal custody of all persons released on parole until they receive their discharge or are recommitted to the prison.\n\n(c) Pursuant to RSA 651-A:18, the board has the sole authority to revoke the parole privilege of any person in its custody and recommit that person to the prison.\n\nSource. #4006, eff 2-28-86; EXPIRED 2-28-92\n\nNew. #5577, Emergency, eff 2-11-93; EXPIRED 6-11-93\n\nNew. #5685, eff 8-16-93; ss by #7070, INTERIM, eff 8-12-99, EXPIRES: 12-10-99; ss and moved by #7148, eff 12-7-99 (from Par 102.01); ss by #12157, eff 4-7-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/par100-500.html"
